first version", that touches only the 123 files. You merge it or
leave it like anything else from submissions.

If you would rather have it as a [PATCH] mail on the list, I can
format that commit as a patch against mail@upstream for you to apply
in ~/lab/mail.jj. The result is the same commit, so I recommend the
plain one.

